Subject: [PATCH 3793/3799] soh: rename func_80B59A80 -> EnZl3_PlayRevengeSfx

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: plays NA_SE_OC_REVENGE when EnZl3_ShouldPlayRevengeSfx fires; called from EnZl3_Init for type 3
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c
index 48c1e7313..0bcedf1bf 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c
@@ -2774,7 +2774,8 @@ void EnZl3_InitInCollapse(EnZl3* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80B59A80(EnZl3* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was func_80B59A80: plays NA_SE_OC_REVENGE when EnZl3_ShouldPlayRevengeSfx fires; called from EnZl3_Init for type 3
+void EnZl3_PlayRevengeSfx(EnZl3* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (EnZl3_ShouldPlayRevengeSfx(this, play)) {  // was func_80B59768 [LLM:GUESS]
         Audio_PlaySfxGeneral(NA_SE_OC_REVENGE, &gSfxDefaultPos, 4, &gSfxDefaultFreqAndVolScale,
                              &gSfxDefaultFreqAndVolScale, &gSfxDefaultReverb);
@@ -2877,7 +2878,7 @@ void EnZl3_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
             gSaveContext.subTimerState = SUBTIMER_STATE_OFF;
             break;
         case 3:
-            func_80B59A80(this, play);
+            EnZl3_PlayRevengeSfx(this, play);  // was func_80B59A80 [LLM:GUESS]
             break;
     }
 
